---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Rules" description="Glitched Network server rules.">
    <main class="legal-page">
        <article>
            <h1 class="font-PressStart2P">Rules</h1>
            <p>These are the basic community rules. Staff may explain or update them when needed.</p>

            <h2 class="font-PressStart2P">Basic Rules</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>No cheating, hacked clients, unfair mods, duping, or exploiting bugs.</li>
                <li>No harassment, hate speech, threats, or targeted toxicity.</li>
                <li>No spam, scams, impersonation, or intentionally disruptive behavior.</li>
                <li>Respect staff decisions and use appeals/support if something needs to be reviewed.</li>
                <li>Keep the server fun. Do not ruin the experience for everyone else.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>
    </main>
</MainLayout>
